00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.170
Fine, I guess.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:38.420
It was announced that you'd be retiring 
from modeling to focus on badminton.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:42.590
I'll be doing my best to live up 
to expectations this coming season.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.760
I appreciate everyone's support.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.350
Don't forget to support me, too!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.450
And the Yaganatsu badminton channel.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.470
Don't forget to subscribe!

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:53.940
Stop, you're embarrassing the team.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:03.710
Nice.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:06.990
What?

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:15.160
Five minute break! After that, 
we're doing physical training.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.580
Ko-san's a real hard-ass.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:18.580
This is impossible.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:21.880
The corporate tournament's coming up.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.840
Show some spirit!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.170
Yes, sir.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:27.800
Coach, where are they?

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.800
Oh, them?

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.850
...and that's our business plan 
for nationwide distribution of

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:34.770
green onion ginger ale.

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.230
Thank you for listening!

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:39.920
Subsection Chief Miyazumi, it's time.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.640
In that case, please excuse me.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:47.180
Today's his last knee checkup?

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:51.620
Yes. It's healing nicely. It should be
 better in time for the tournament.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:57.580
You're impressive, you know that?

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:01.210
You got Waoko to like you on your first day.

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.010
You like cars, huh?

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:07.520
I just looked up the president's 
interests beforehand.

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.260
I don't care about cars.

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:11.160
I see.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:16.620
Isn't visiting clients every day so they'll 
remember you a waste of time?

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:22.190
Aren't both work and badminton about using 
the data to efficiently produce results?

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:25.410
That's not much fun.

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:27.910
What does that mean?

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:32.160
Don't worry, newbie. I'll teach you all about

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:35.080
the joys of being a Badaryman.

